WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.633
There's one job in your business that

00:00:02.773 --> 00:00:03.713
nobody wants.

00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:04.700
You know the one.

00:00:05.164 --> 00:00:06.976
It gets done by hand every time,

00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:09.042
because that's how it's always been done.

00:00:09.228 --> 00:00:10.900
Two hours a go, forty times a

00:00:10.946 --> 00:00:13.199
month, and nobody has a spare afternoon

00:00:13.245 --> 00:00:13.884
to fix it.

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:15.428
You don't need advice.

00:00:15.764 --> 00:00:17.065
You need someone to come and take

00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:17.854
it off you.

00:00:18.504 --> 00:00:19.572
So that's what we do.

00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:21.790
We don't send a proposal and disappear.

00:00:22.126 --> 00:00:23.508
We sit with your team, in your

00:00:23.554 --> 00:00:25.911
business, and learn how the work actually

00:00:25.946 --> 00:00:26.573
gets done.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.210
Then we build it so it runs

00:00:28.256 --> 00:00:28.907
itself.

00:00:29.441 --> 00:00:30.764
The person who tells you what it'll

00:00:30.811 --> 00:00:32.471
take is the person who builds it.

00:00:32.877 --> 00:00:34.689
No sales team, no handover.

00:00:35.025 --> 00:00:37.220
Something working in weeks, not next year.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:38.520
Here's one.

00:00:38.706 --> 00:00:40.529
A training company was signing up students

00:00:40.564 --> 00:00:41.237
by hand.

00:00:41.457 --> 00:00:42.827
Two hours a student.

00:00:43.048 --> 00:00:44.685
We took it apart and rebuilt it.

00:00:45.149 --> 00:00:46.601
Now it takes two minutes.

00:00:46.786 --> 00:00:49.155
Sixty times faster, and about thirty-nine hours

00:00:49.225 --> 00:00:50.722
back on every group of twenty.

00:00:51.187 --> 00:00:52.266
Nobody wrote a report.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:53.567
We just fixed it.

00:00:54.217 --> 00:00:55.819
And we build the thing itself.

00:00:56.179 --> 00:00:58.536
For BrightCover, a website and the lead

00:00:58.606 --> 00:01:01.984
system behind it, so enquiries answer themselves

00:01:02.112 --> 00:01:03.528
and nothing gets lost.

00:01:03.888 --> 00:01:05.281
Live in three weeks.

00:01:05.548 --> 00:01:08.091
For NookTek, a portal their students log

00:01:08.161 --> 00:01:10.773
into, that they run without us.

00:01:11.132 --> 00:01:12.955
And SeatStep is ours.

00:01:13.315 --> 00:01:16.160
A real app, on iPhone and Android.

00:01:16.647 --> 00:01:18.412
It walks you from the turnstile to

00:01:18.482 --> 00:01:20.641
your seat, shows you a live map

00:01:20.687 --> 00:01:22.359
of the place, and you hold your

00:01:22.394 --> 00:01:24.136
phone up and it points the way.

00:01:24.623 --> 00:01:28.106
Websites, apps, dashboards, AI that does

00:01:28.141 --> 00:01:29.116
a real job.

00:01:29.685 --> 00:01:31.601
Same people every time.

00:01:32.251 --> 00:01:34.294
This normally costs what a big company

00:01:34.364 --> 00:01:35.095
pays for it.

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:38.033
We built ours for businesses your size,

00:01:38.195 --> 00:01:40.065
because that's where the work happens.

00:01:40.424 --> 00:01:42.561
And when we're done, it's yours.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.160
The code, the system, the instructions, and

00:01:46.195 --> 00:01:47.936
the ability to run it without us.

00:01:48.169 --> 00:01:49.237
If you still need us in a

00:01:49.283 --> 00:01:50.758
year, we built it wrong.

00:01:51.117 --> 00:01:52.209
Give us twenty minutes.

00:01:52.348 --> 00:01:53.939
Let's give you your time back, while

00:01:53.974 --> 00:01:55.564
we grow your business.
